  "title": "Provider-neutral tracker seam and the first GitHub adapter",
  "summary": "Adds a provider-neutral `Tracker` seam to the osf crate — a trait, its data types, a ready rule, a finishing-write helper, and an in-memory test double — plus the first adapter, `GitHubTracker`, which drives GitHub Issues and Projects v2 through the installed `gh` CLI. Every `gh` request is one invocation whose argv and JSON payload are built by pure functions and whose response is read by a pure parser, so the adapter is a thin loop over a `GhRunner` trait. The change is purely additive: nothing existing is modified beyond two `pub mod` lines in `lib.rs`.",
